flowchart LR
  Devices[Member devices] --> Events[Playback, search, impression events]
  Events --> Keystone[Keystone / Kafka]
  Keystone --> Flink[Flink stream processing]
  Keystone --> DataMesh[Data Mesh pipelines]
  Flink --> Realtime[Near-real-time features]
  DataMesh --> Iceberg[Iceberg data products]
  Iceberg --> Spark[Spark / warehouse jobs]
  Realtime --> Recs[Personalization services]
  Spark --> Training[Recommendation training]
  Training --> Recs
  Recs --> Experience[Rows, search, artwork, and title choices]
  Experience --> Events
